            <ArticleTitle>Recurrent wheezing … is it only asthma?</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr.04.2009.1731</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr04.2009.1731</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of an 18-year-old female patient observed in our allergy clinic with a diagnosis of uncontrolled asthma. The unexpected behaviour of the disease led us to consider other diagnoses and we finally diagnosed Churg-Strauss syndrome, a rare multisystem disorder requiring a different clinical approach.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
